---
// Override of Starlight's ThemeProvider. We always run in dark mode, so instead
// of reading a stored preference or the system setting we hard-set `data-theme`
// to "dark" and persist it so nothing else can flip it back to light.
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	try {
		localStorage.setItem('starlight-theme', 'dark');
	} catch {}
</script>
